# Copy to .env.local for development. Read at bundle time by Expo.
#
# Where the API is. Leave unset for production (https://eventsli.com/api/v1).
# A development build may use plain HTTP to a laptop on the same Wi-Fi; a
# store build ignores anything that is not https (src/api/client.ts).
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.20:5000/api/v1
